  "decision": "GO_bounded_alternative_resource_selection_and_timing",
  "accepted_scope": "For this fixed one-hour, two-aircraft mission, a 20-minute INSPECT preparation subtask per aircraft uses primary P-CREW when two are available despite ARTF=2. With zero primary and two P-ALT, each selects P-ALT. ARTF=1 retains 7.5-7.83333 preparation and 8-9 mission timing; ARTF=2 extends preparation to 8.16667 and shifts the mission to 8.16667-9.16667. Selected resources release at preparation completion; all variants finish with two ready aircraft.",
  "limits": [
    "One fixed seed, one site, one alternative type, primary capacity two/zero and ARTF one/two only; mixed shortages, multiple alternatives, and any maximum-factor rule remain unverified.",
    "RPROB is one, so probabilistic need is untested.",
    "INSPECT identity is bound by source/roundtrip; native event log labels generic subtasks.",
    "ResourceResults aggregates types; per-type selection is established by sealed event logs and corroborated by aggregate report totals.",
    "SSH/GUI/queue continuity is replayed from sealed records; this reviewer did not observe or rerun native SIMLOX live."
  ],
